  "description": "YITAMOTOR® 6\" running boards are made of high-quality materials to serve you for years to come. It will meet your needs and deliver great quality at an affordable cost.\nFitment\nfor 2007-2018 Chevy Silverado 1500 Crew cab\nfor 2007-2018 GMC Sierra 1500 Crew cab\nfor 2007-2019 Chevy Silverado 2500 HD/3500 HD Crew Cab\nfor 2007-2019 GMC Sierra 2500 HD/3500 HD Crew Cab\nNot fit for Diesel Models Equipped with DEF Tank\nDOES NOT FIT 2019 Silverado/Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\nDOES NOT FIT Diesel Models Equipped with DEF Tank\nDOES NOT FIT 2007 Silverado classic or 2019 Silverado 1500 LD\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2007-2018 Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500 & 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab with 4 full-size doors, 2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab with 4 full-size doors (Gas Engine ONLY)\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent performance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
